In accordance with regular LLG policy, the names and net-addresses of
lojban-list subscribers will be made available to other Lojbanists (whether
net-connected or not) for the purpose of encouraging conversations in
or about Lojban or otherwise promoting the language.  The names will not
be made available to other parties or for other purposes.

If anyone wishes their presence on lojban-list to be treated as confidential,
please notify me at once.

